Z||000011||Standard||02-18-2000||01:58 AM||||I prefer to call them my starch deployment research devices..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  or the tree bark removers.  or the shed-denters.  But even with a moderatly powerful spud gun you can hurt, maim, or even kill.  definatly not toys.   A well-built gun will shoot an average of 100 yards.  <P>My GT's pretty rough, too.  Need a new decklid, pass. side ground effect, and a paint job.  New quarter panels, too.  I'm workin' on getting her tuned up good for the summer.  I would like to join MFF, but the meetings are monday nights and I have to work.. but I'm gonna be lookin' for a different job soon...  good luck with the GT!  hope it doesn't drain all your cash!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||3
